From b6a1117c6ecdd79edb5d48e709fec743cbb26dcc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:50:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add pack.os-taxonomy: cross-platform OS capability library
 with Windows realizations

- data/: 291 platform-neutral capabilities in 25 domains, 305 Windows realizations,
  164-task average-user coverage inventory; effect-derived risk/consent
- one routed op per capability (os.<r|m|x>.<id>@1) => law gates and consents per capability
- pure plan renderer (literal-only parameter injection), executor via platformSpawn,
  attempt/outcome ledger in vault ns 'os', execute:false by default
- derived plugin.json + compositions/os.json, SQLite builder, CATALOG.md
- law policy 1.9.0: os.catalog.*/os.r.*/os.m.*/os.x.* prefix rows
- tests: integrity, plans, safety, e2e boot with consent, pwsh parse of all scripts,
  execution path via pwsh
